//
// MoonProbe - reporter package
//
// The `reporter` package converts raw test results into human- and
// machine-readable output.
//
// Planned responsibilities (landed in the dedicated reporter feature commits):
//
//   - human-readable console test report with pass / fail summary
//   - JUnit XML report generation for CI integration
//   - optional default output to a file or stdout
//
// This module is intentionally empty in the scaffold commit and is filled in
// by the dedicated reporter feature commits.